  "principles": [
    "Do not inflate or suppress resources to force a desired simulation outcome.",
    "landQuality is an area-weighted productive-land index for the whole game region, not the fertility of its best field.",
    "forestFraction is the share capable of carrying meaningful exploitable woodland; forestStartCoverage reflects c.1300 BCE clearance.",
    "Metal deposits represent geology and archaeologically plausible access. Absence is intentional.",
    "Deposit classes are coarse first-pass geological magnitudes; economic calibration belongs in the model, not geography."
